  eventID: PlayerStandingStillTwo
  dialogueLines:
  - The player is still not moving. This is beginning to feel a little unnerving.
  - "The player hasn\u2019t moved in quite some time. Is everything alright?"
  - Still no movement from the player. The narrator is starting to become concerned.
  - The player remains completely still. This is starting to feel rather strange.
  - The player is still standing there. The narrator is beginning to wonder if something
    is wrong.
  - Not a single step. The player has been still for far too long.
  - "The player hasn\u2019t moved. The narrator is starting to find this rather concerning."
  - Still standing there? The narrator is beginning to feel a little uneasy.
  - The player continues to stand perfectly still. This is becoming increasingly
    unsettling.
  - "The player is still frozen in place. The narrator isn\u2019t sure this is normal."
